<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Fuller named Merrill Focus.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Fuller named Merrill Focus.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised H.B. Fuller Co to both near-term and long-term buy from accumulate and named the company to its Focus One stock list.</p>
</text>
